message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite the archived release."
title: "How reference life tables shape comparisons of premature mortality from malignant CNS tumours across Europe (analysis code)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a study of how the choice between national and common
  reference life tables changes age-standardised years-of-life-lost rates and country comparisons
  for the same recorded deaths, for malignant central nervous system neoplasms (ICD-10 C70-C72) in 28 European countries,
  2012-2018, and eight comparison causes.
type: software
